sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Operator as KubeRay Operator
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant AuthCtrl as AuthenticationController
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Pod<br/>8265/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over User,RayHead: Flow 1: RayCluster Provisioning

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayCluster CR<br/>Auth: User RBAC
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/9443
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Sets secure-trusted-network annotation,<br/>disables direct ingress
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/9443
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    K8sAPI-->>User: RayCluster created

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch RayCluster events<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create head/worker Pods, Services<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Certificate + Issuer CRs<br/>(mTLS for head/worker)
    CertMgr-->>Operator: Certificates provisioned
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount, RoleBinding,<br/>ConfigMap for OAuth proxy
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute for Gateway<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>into head pod

    Note over User,RayHead: Flow 2: Ray Dashboard Access (OpenShift)

    User->>Gateway: GET /dashboard<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: OIDC
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    KRBAC->>RayHead: Proxy to dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP (localhost)<br/>Auth: None
    RayHead-->>KRBAC: Dashboard response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Dashboard UI

    Note over User,RayHead: Flow 3: RayJob Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayJob CR<br/>Auth: User RBAC
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/9443
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create transient RayCluster CR<br/>(if not using existing)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create submitter Job<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Note right of Operator: Submitter Job runs<br/>ray job submit
    K8sAPI->>RayHead: Submitter Job → Ray Jobs API<br/>8265/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>Auth: None / mTLS
    RayHead-->>K8sAPI: Job status updates
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update RayJob status<br/>Cleanup on completion
